[#4471](/kb/incidents/4471/) holds every report about a wrong date, merged on subject lines alone
([decision 0001](/kb/decisions/0001-dedupe-by-subject/)), and its page says "One issue". Rendered,
the same page shows more: its own table finds two causes and flags one as having no ticket, and a
footnote holds reports that fit neither. This page splits the reports merged into #4471 by problem.
Each problem has one ticket, and each report counts in one problem.

